<title>USA: Tel-Save sees Q3 20-30 pct above estimates.</title>
<headline>Tel-Save sees Q3 20-30 pct above estimates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HOPE, Pa. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tel-Save Holdings Inc said on Friday it expected third quarter earnings per share to be 20 to 30 percent higher than analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>&quot;Tel-Save expects to report record income and 20 percent to 30 percent higher earnings per share than analysts expectations for the third quarter,&quot; Tel-Save Chief Executive and Chairman Dan Borislow said in a statement.</p>
</text>
